Adapted from examples/cfd/vortex_shedding_mgn at commit
b45a5c810c741e6b41f8515be24c51121f8fc21f:

  configs/official.yaml       from conf/config.yaml (keys and values kept, except the
                              hydra block and data_dir; keys added below a marker)
  src/mgn_vortex/model.py     MeshGraphNet construction from train.py
  src/mgn_vortex/engine.py    MGNTrainer and the epoch loop from train.py
  src/mgn_vortex/rollout.py   MGNRollout.predict from inference.py

Each of these files carries the original NVIDIA copyright and licence header and
a statement of the changes. The MeshGraphNet model, the VortexSheddingDataset
class (graph construction, noise, normalisation) and the checkpoint utilities are
imported from the PhysicsNeMo package and are not copied.

The data are DeepMind's cylinder_flow dataset, released with "Learning Mesh-Based
Simulation with Graph Networks" (Pfaff et al., ICLR 2021) at
https://github.com/google-deepmind/deepmind-research/tree/master/meshgraphnets.
No data files are distributed with this repository.
